<title>USA: Cole Taylor Financial spinoff next week.</title>
<headline>Cole Taylor Financial spinoff next week.</headline>
<dateline>WHEELING, Ill. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cole Taylor Financial Group Inc said Friday the spinoff of its Cole Taylor Bank unit will close on Wednesday.</p>
<p>As announced in early 1996, Cole Taylor is spinning off the division to a shareholder group led by the founding Taylor family.</p>
<p>Cole Taylor said it will change its name to Reliance Acceptance Group Inc immediately after the deal closes.</p>
<p>Its shares closed unchanged Friday at 17-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
